{"text":"kuruntokai","n":204,"lines":["காமம் காமம் என்ப காமம்","அணங்கும் பிணியும் அன்றே நினைப்பின்","முதைச்சுவற் கலித்த முற்றா இளம்புல்","மூதா தைவந் தாங்கு","விருந்தே காமம் பெருந்தோ ளோயே"],"tr":["kāmam kāmam eṉpa kāmam","aṇaṅkum piṇiyum aṉṟē niṉaippiṉ","mutaiccuvaṟ kalitta muṟṟā iḷampul","mūtā taivan tāṅku","viruntē kāmam peruntō ḷōyē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"பாங்கன் கூற்று","poet_ta":"மிளைப்பெருங் கந்தனார்","speaker_en":"the hero's companion (pāṅkaṉ)","poet_tr":"Miḷaipperuṅ Kantaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 19"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 11, veṇṭaḷai 7"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"காமம்","tr":"kāmam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மம்","tr":"mam"}]},{"text":"காமம்","tr":"kāmam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மம்","tr":"mam"}]},{"text":"என்ப","tr":"eṉpa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"என்","tr":"eṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ப","tr":"pa"}]},{"text":"காமம்","tr":"kāmam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மம்","tr":"mam"}]}],[{"text":"அணங்கும்","tr":"aṇaṅkum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அணங்","tr":"aṇaṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கும்","tr":"kum"}]},{"text":"பிணியும்","tr":"piṇiyum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பிணி","tr":"piṇi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யும்","tr":"yum"}]},{"text":"அன்றே","tr":"aṉṟē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அன்","tr":"aṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றே","tr":"ṟē"}]},{"text":"நினைப்பின்","tr":"niṉaippiṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நினைப்","tr":"niṉaip"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பின்","tr":"piṉ"}]}],[{"text":"முதைச்சுவற்","tr":"mutaiccuvaṟ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"முதைச்","tr":"mutaic"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"சுவற்","tr":"cuvaṟ"}]},{"text":"கலித்த","tr":"kalitta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கலித்","tr":"kalit"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"முற்றா","tr":"muṟṟā","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"முற்","tr":"muṟ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றா","tr":"ṟā"}]},{"text":"இளம்புல்","tr":"iḷampul","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இளம்","tr":"iḷam"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"புல்","tr":"pul"}]}],[{"text":"மூதா","tr":"mūtā","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மூ","tr":"mū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தா","tr":"tā"}]},{"text":"தைவந்","tr":"taivan","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தை","tr":"tai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வந்","tr":"van"}]},{"text":"தாங்கு","tr":"tāṅku","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தாங்","tr":"tāṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கு","tr":"ku"}]}],[{"text":"விருந்தே","tr":"viruntē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"விருந்","tr":"virun"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"}]},{"text":"காமம்","tr":"kāmam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மம்","tr":"mam"}]},{"text":"பெருந்தோ","tr":"peruntō","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெருந்","tr":"perun"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"}]},{"text":"ளோயே","tr":"ḷōyē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளோ","tr":"ḷō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யே","tr":"yē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"காமம்","parts":[{"text":"காமம்","lemma":"kāmam","gloss":"desire"}],"gloss":"desire"},{"surface":"காமம்","parts":[{"text":"காமம்","lemma":"kāmam","gloss":"desire"}],"gloss":"desire"},{"surface":"என்ப","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"eṉ","gloss":"say"},{"text":"ப","lemma":"pa","gloss":"they (neuter/plural suffix)"}],"gloss":"they say"},{"surface":"காமம்","parts":[{"text":"காமம்","lemma":"kāmam","gloss":"desire"}],"gloss":"desire"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அணங்கும்","parts":[{"text":"அணங்கு","lemma":"aṇaṅku","gloss":"tormenting spirit"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and tormenting spirit"},{"surface":"பிணியும்","parts":[{"text":"பிணி","lemma":"piṇi","gloss":"sickness"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and sickness"},{"surface":"அன்றே","parts":[{"text":"அன்று","lemma":"aṉṟu","gloss":"it is not"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"it is indeed not"},{"surface":"நினைப்பின்","parts":[{"text":"நினைப்பு","lemma":"niṉaippu","gloss":"thinking"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"if"}],"gloss":"if one thinks about it"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"முதைச்சுவல்","parts":[{"text":"முதை","lemma":"mutai","gloss":"old fallow land"},{"text":"சுவல்","lemma":"cuval","gloss":"high ground"}],"gloss":"on the old fallow high ground"},{"surface":"கலித்த","parts":[{"text":"கலி","lemma":"kali","gloss":"sprout"},{"text":"த்த","lemma":"tta","gloss":"past relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"that sprouted"},{"surface":"முற்றா","parts":[{"text":"முற்று","lemma":"muṟṟu","gloss":"mature"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ā","gloss":"negative relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"unripened"},{"surface":"இளம்புல்","parts":[{"text":"இளம்","lemma":"iḷam","gloss":"young"},{"text":"புல்","lemma":"pul","gloss":"grass"}],"gloss":"tender grass"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மூதா","parts":[{"text":"மூதா","lemma":"மூதா","gloss":"old cow"}],"gloss":"old cow","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தைவந்து","parts":[{"text":"தைவ","lemma":"taiva","gloss":"stroke"},{"text":"ந்து","lemma":"ntu","gloss":"having (past participle)"}],"gloss":"having gently stroked"},{"surface":"ஆங்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஆங்கு","lemma":"āṅku","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"விருந்தே","parts":[{"text":"விருந்து","lemma":"viruntu","gloss":"fresh delight"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed a fresh delight"},{"surface":"காமம்","parts":[{"text":"காமம்","lemma":"kāmam","gloss":"desire"}],"gloss":"desire"},{"surface":"பெருந்தோளோயே","parts":[{"text":"பெருந்தோளோயே","lemma":"பெருந்தோளோயே","gloss":"O one with broad shoulders!"}],"gloss":"O one with broad shoulders!","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"Desire, desire, they say, desire / is indeed not a tormenting spirit and sickness, if one thinks about it. / On the old fallow high ground sprouted unripened tender grass / like an old cow having gently stroked, / desire is indeed a fresh delight, O one with broad shoulders!","translation":"\"Desire, desire,\" they say of desire. But if you think about it, desire is neither a tormenting spirit nor a disease. Like an old cow gently stroking with its tongue the tender, young grass sprouted on an old fallow ridge, desire is a fresh delight, O strong-shouldered one!","modern":"காமம், காமம் என்று காமத்தைப் பற்றிச் சொல்கிறார்கள். ஆனால் சிந்தித்துப் பார்த்தால், காமம் என்பது வருத்தும் தெய்வமோ அல்லது நோயோ அல்ல. பழைய தரிசு நிலத்து மேட்டில் முளைத்த முதிராத இளம்புல்லை ஒரு வயதான பசு தன் நாவினால் மென்மையாகத் தடவிக் கொடுப்பதைப் போல, காமம் என்பது ஒரு புதிய இன்பமே ஆகும், பெரிய தோள்களை உடையவனே!","explanation":"In this poem, the friend (pāṅkaṉ) speaks to the hero who is suffering from the intense longing of love. While others might describe love as a painful affliction or a tormenting spirit (aṇaṅku) that drains a person's strength, the friend offers a comforting perspective. He uses a tender image from the pastoral landscape: an old cow gently licking and caressing the fresh, young grass growing on an old fallow ridge. The cow does not greedily destroy the grass but finds a quiet, soothing pleasure in its touch. Similarly, love is not a destructive disease but a gentle, comforting, and fresh delight (viruntu) that brings deep solace to the soul.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}